*---------------------- EXTENDED HEADER FIELD
* Authored as `.pms` with the PMS-STD channel layout: 1P side `11..15`
* (POPN keys 1..5 = Z S X D C) plus 2P-side POPN columns `22..25` (POPN
* keys 6..9 = F V G B). Every quarter note in measures 1..4 hits all
* nine lanes simultaneously, so AUTO PLAY paints a column of 9 sprites
* falling in unison and manual play requires a 9-finger chord on every
* beat (= visual + timer-stamping verification, not playable hand-wise).
*
* This chart exists to validate:
*   - PMS-STD channel layout (`POPN_9KEY_PMS_BINDINGS` routes 22..25 → lanes 6..9)
*   - 9-key chord rendering with the maximum simultaneous-press count
*   - The skin's `play_9.lr2skin` / `play_9.json` lane chrome lines up
*     all 9 sprite columns

#PLAYER 1
#LNTYPE 1

*---------------------- RESOURCES FIELD

#WAV01 sample.wav

*---------------------- OBJECT DATA FIELD

* Measure 0 — empty count-in (one bar of silence so the player can read
* the first chord before it lands)

* Measures 1..4 — quarter-note chord on every lane.
* Encoding: 8 chars / 2 = 4 slots per channel = 4 quarter notes per measure,
* with `01` (= #WAV01) at every position.

